lf-contract 0.1
# A deliberately wrong contract: claims lf-checked-add always succeeds with
# the mathematical sum. It fails, for example, on the largest cell plus 1.
id lf-checked-add/wrong-total
word lf-checked-add
ir tests/program/ir/examples.ir
stack ( a b -- sum true | false )
inputs a b
statement Wrong on purpose: claims every sum of two cells is returned with true.
case true
  out s true
  ensure s = a + b
expect refuted
